From 4c88cc5f5feddc4390dc62d87dc07fe4b0fa3381 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jon West <electrikjesus@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 16:21:02 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 3/8] Taskbar: Show SystemUI's status bar icons in the system
 bar tray

The tray now shows the status bar's own slot icons (Bluetooth, alarm, Do
Not Disturb, location, hotspot, VPN, ...) next to its network and battery
icons, using the icons SystemUI sends through ILauncherProxy, so nothing
is lost when the top status bar is hidden.

Needs the frameworks/base ILauncherProxy onStatusBarIconsChanged callback.

Change-Id: Iba16ddfca360fc25e25a7a98af5fe5e67e404860
---
